From 30789ae835ce6232eadb269a02e3396e471f8762 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CanMehEvolve <noreply@example.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Field::GetNumSubFields: branch hints on the null/range checks

What: caches profile in a local and adds __builtin_expect hints.
Why it might be faster: probably marginal; measured 0.06% at search time, i.e. noise. Included only because the search accepted it.

Provenance: greedy search, seed 3, generation 37, region 128 (Field::GetNumSubFields).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8565 -> 0.8560 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s3-1072869/patches/gen_37.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_field.cpp | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_field.cpp b/src/fit_field.cpp
index c621405..07fd6c3 100644
--- a/src/fit_field.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_field.cpp
@@ -139,9 +139,12 @@ FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
 
 FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
 {
-    if ((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields))
+    const auto* p = profile;
+    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
+        return 0;
+    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= p->numFields, 0))
         return 0;
-    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
+    return p->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
 }
 
 FIT_BOOL Field::GetIsExpanded(void) const
